'<!-- Section properties of a Zed (Z) profile: area, centroid, $I_x$, $I_y$, principal axes and radii of gyration. -->
'<h1>Geometrical Properties of Zed Section</h1>
'<div style="max-width:120mm"><img style="height:150pt;" alt="zed.png" class="side" src="../../Images/mechanics/sections/zed.png"></div>
'Dimensions
#UI 'Height -'h = 20m', Web thickness -'t_w = 2m
#UI 'Flange width -'b_f = 10m', Flange thickness -'t_f = 5m
'Area
A_w = h*t_w
A_f = (b_f - t_w)*t_f
A = A_w + 2*A_f
'Centroid
y_c = b_f - t_w/2
z_c = h/2
'Perimeter
P = 2*(h + 2*b_f - t_w)
'Second moments of area
I_y = (b_f*h^3 - (b_f - t_w)*(h - 2*t_f)^3)/12
I_z = ((h - 2*t_f)*t_w^3 + 2*t_f*b_f*(b_f^2 + 3*(b_f - t_w)^2))/12
I_yz = -b_f*(h - t_f)*A_f/2
'Principal moments of area
I_1 = (I_y + I_z)/2 + sqrt((I_y - I_z)^2/4 + I_yz^2)
I_2 = (I_y + I_z)/2 - sqrt((I_y - I_z)^2/4 + I_yz^2)
'Angle of principal axis
α_1 = atan((I_y - I_1)/I_yz)
'Polar moment of area
I_x=I_1+I_2
'Radii of gyration
r_y = sqr(I_y/A)
r_z = sqr(I_z/A)
r_x = sqr(I_x/A)
